WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.425
Changing the subject turns a formula around.

2
00:00:04.102 --> 00:00:07.302
This formula gives P from l and w.

3
00:00:08.003 --> 00:00:12.203
Undo the add, then the times: w is P take two l, halved.

4
00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:17.180
Twenty take twelve is eight, halved is four. The board agrees.
